118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (Each year begins with a full staff training conference where we set out our vision and plan the year ahead. This includes building a comprehensive training programme and scheduling activities across the calendar.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (We carefully balance delivering high-impact opportunities for cadets with maintaining a manageable workload for staff. This ensures that every cadet, from their first night on the squadron to those progressing towards becoming staff themselves is challenged, supported, and developed.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (This approach creates a continuous pipeline of talent. In fact, 8 out of our 10 staff members were once cadets at 317, something we are incredibly proud of.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [17]
>>
