148 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (Managing such a comprehensive training programme is no small task, at times, it can feel like a second job. Even when faced with unexpected challenges, such as a temporary building closure, we remain undeterred. By relocating to an alternative venue, we have ensured continuity, proving that while the surroundings may change, the quality of our training does not.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (None of this would be possible without the dedication of our staff and cadet NCOs. Their commitment, professionalism, and passion are what drive 317 Failsworth Squadron forward and make everything we do possible.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [18]
>>
